sequenceDiagram
    participant FastAPI
    participant SummarizationGraph
    participant Node0_Intake
    participant Node1_Classifier
    participant Node2_Extractor
    participant Node3_Aggregator
    participant Node4A_Clustering
    participant Node4B_Synthesis
    participant Node5_Brief
    participant MongoDB

    FastAPI->>SummarizationGraph: invoke(documents, case_id)

    par ThreadPoolExecutor — one thread per document
        SummarizationGraph->>Node0_Intake: process(doc_1)
    and
        SummarizationGraph->>Node0_Intake: process(doc_2 … doc_N)
    end
    Note over Node0_Intake: extract doc_type + party per doc [low LLM]
    Node0_Intake->>Node0_Intake: disambiguate_defendants()
    Node0_Intake-->>SummarizationGraph: chunks[] + party_manifest

    SummarizationGraph->>Node1_Classifier: classify chunks by legal role [low LLM]
    Node1_Classifier-->>SummarizationGraph: classified_chunks[]

    SummarizationGraph->>Node2_Extractor: extract atomic bullets per chunk [high LLM]
    Node2_Extractor-->>SummarizationGraph: bullets[]

    SummarizationGraph->>Node3_Aggregator: group bullets by role [high LLM]
    Note over Node3_Aggregator: labels: متفق عليه / محل النزاع / خاص بطرف
    Node3_Aggregator-->>SummarizationGraph: role_aggregations[]

    SummarizationGraph->>Node4A_Clustering: cluster bullets into 3-7 themes per role [low LLM]
    Node4A_Clustering-->>SummarizationGraph: themed_roles[]

    SummarizationGraph->>Node4B_Synthesis: generate Arabic prose per theme [high LLM]
    Note over Node4B_Synthesis: cite bullet IDs in output
    Node4B_Synthesis-->>SummarizationGraph: role_theme_summaries[]

    SummarizationGraph->>Node5_Brief: generate 7-section judge-facing brief [high LLM]
    Node5_Brief-->>SummarizationGraph: case_brief + rendered_brief + all_sources

    SummarizationGraph->>MongoDB: upsert summaries collection
    MongoDB-->>SummarizationGraph: ack
    SummarizationGraph-->>FastAPI: case_brief + rendered_brief
